{{Term/Store|Raw Bird Drumstick|Raw Bird Drumsticks|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Raw Bird Drumsticks are dropped by [[Wood Pigeon]]s, [[Mountain Crow]]s, [[Bright-Chested Duck]]s, [[Blue-Winged Heron]]s, [[Pink Heron]]s, and [[Seagull]]s when they are killed. They can also be purchased from the traveling [[Merchant]] [[Mezer]]. Raw Bird Drumsticks restore one [[Heart]] when eaten. They can be exposed to [[Fire]] to make [[Roasted Bird Drumstick]]s or chilled by [[Ice]] to make [[Frozen Bird Drumstick]]s.

When making [[Food]] in a [[Cooking Pot]], a Raw Bird Drumstick is required to make [[Poultry Pilaf]] and [[Poultry Curry]]. Either [[Raw Meat]] or a Raw Bird Drumstick can be used to make [[Meat Stew]] and [[Salt-Grilled Meat]]. They are also among the [[Meat]]s that can be used to make [[Creamy Meat Soup]], [[Glazed Meat]], a [[Meat and Mushroom Skewer]], [[Meat Pie]], a [[Meat Skewer]], [[Copious Meat Skewers]], [[Meaty Rice Balls]], [[Monster Stew]], [[Pepper Steak]], [[Steamed Meat]], and a [[Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin]].

==={{TotK|-}}===
Raw Bird Drumsticks reappear in {{TotK}} as [[Material]]s dropped when [[Bird]]s are killed.

